  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1033286,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st End, The - Commodore 64\n\nStep onto the virtual pitch and experience the thrill of managing a football team in *1st End, The*! This fast-paced, action-packed game for the Commodore 64 puts you in charge of a squad battling for glory in England's top four leagues. Choose your club and lead them to victory, navigating the challenges of competitive football.\n\nGameplay revolves around a blend of strategic team management and exciting match simulations. Scout for new talent, train your players to improve their skills, and carefully select your starting lineup. After each match, receive detailed reports on injuries, rival results, and your club's finances – crucial for long-term success. \n\n*1st End, The* delivers a realistic and engaging football management experience, demanding shrewd decision-making and tactical prowess. Can you guide your team to championship success and become a legendary manager? Prepare for intense competition, unexpected setbacks, and the ultimate reward: lifting the trophy!"
    },
